Today is my first day.
I am standing in front of the building.
It is January.
Outside it is cold.
I open the door.
I go into the office.
Here it is warm.
I take off my jacket.
I stand there and look around.
The office is large and bright.
Many people are working here.
I think for a moment.
I am thirty-one years old.
I come from Mexico.
Now I live in Berlin.
I have a new job.
I work here as a software engineer.
This is a big step.
I am ready.
